arvan hij precies wordt beschuldigd. Terwijl hij probeert zich te verdedigen, blijkt het juridische systeem om hem heen ondoorzichtig en moeilijk te bereiken. Iedere poging duidelijkheid te krijgen leidt naar nieuwe onzekerheid. De roman volgt hoe zijn verhouding tot het proces geleidelijk verandert en hoe het steeds meer ruimte in zijn leven inneemt. Kafka beschrijft een wereld waarin formele procedures overal aanwezig zijn, terwijl hun betekenis buiten bereik blijft.","work_id":987111001,"evidence":[{"note":"Kafka’s Der Prozess novel, exact Dutch hardcover. Do not infer original publication from the later KB cited1935printing; no year change proposed. DNB-held bibliographic research cites first DieSchmiede,Berlin1925 and distinguishes Schocken1935. Current1825 is corrected to first book1925, not the later edition year.","type":"reviewed_identity_and_bibliography","sources":["http://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p821427601"],"reference":"work:177","checked_at":"2026-11-02T19:50:00.000Z","supplemental":null},{"type":"original_substantive_source_review","review":"content-review-017.json","sources":["https://d-nb.info/1332299970/34","https://d-nb.info/1002458579/34","https://openlibrary.org/works/OL498463W","https://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p821427601"]},{"type":"cover_front_review","sha256":"15e721f65fb55cd17e3ad1e7360d9a3847ffdff687dff730f252316c48a32aa5","cover_id":6723312,"reference":"cover-semantic-review-010.json","limitation":"Actually read cover-large/sheet-002.jpg. Franz Kafka; Het proces; Querido. Front identity and source-edition attachment are corroboration, not proof of a visible barcode, printing year, language or complete contents. Bibliographic checks remain separate."}],"language":"nl","provenance":"original_source_reviewed_summary","source_url":"https://d-nb.info/1332299970/34","reviewed_at":"2026-11-02T19:50:00+00:00","source_name":"Gecontroleerde boek- en catalogusbronnen","source_type":"official_catalog","review_batch":"nl-scale-20261102-012","review_status":"approved","bound_author_id":987310001},"before_row":null},{"key":{"edition_id":987211008},"seq":8,"relation":"catalog_edition_metadata","after_row":{"format":"hardcover","work_id":987111001,"evidence":[{"note":"Kafka’s Der Prozess novel, exact Dutch hardcover. Do not infer original publication from the later KB cited1935printing; no year change proposed. DNB-held bibliographic research cites first DieSchmiede,Berlin1925 and distinguishes Schocken1935. Current1825 is corrected to first book1925, not the later edition year.","type":"reviewed_identity_and_bibliography","sources":["http://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p821427601"],"reference":"work:177","checked_at":"2026-11-02T19:50:00.000Z","supplemental":null},{"type":"original_substantive_source_review","review":"content-review-017.json","sources":["https://d-nb.info/1332299970/34","https://d-nb.info/1002458579/34","https://openlibrary.org/works/OL498463W","https://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p821427601"]},{"type":"cover_front_review","sha256":"15e721f65fb55cd17e3ad1e7360d9a3847ffdff687dff730f252316c48a32aa5","cover_id":6723312,"reference":"cover-semantic-review-010.json","limitation":"Actually read cover-large/sheet-002.jpg. Franz Kafka; Het proces; Querido. Front identity and source-edition attachment are corroboration, not proof of a visible barcode, printing year, language or complete contents. Bibliographic checks remain separate."}],"cover_url":"https://covers.openlibrary.org/b/id/6723312-L.jpg?default=false","edition_id":987211008,"bound_title":"Het proces","reviewed_at":"2026-11-02T19:50:00+00:00","bound_isbn13":"9789021469911","evidence_url":"https://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p821427601","review_batch":"nl-scale-20261102-012","review_status":"approved","bound_language":"dut","card_cover_url":"https://covers.openlibrary.org/b/id/6723312-M.jpg?default=false","bound_author_id":987310001},"before_row":null},{"key":{"open_library_edition_id":"OL24354728M"},"seq":9,"relation":"editions","after_row":{"id":987211009,"title":"Emma","isbn_10":null,"isbn_13":"9789027491428","work_id":987111002,"cover_id":null,"language":"dut","publisher":"Het Spectrum","publish_date":null,"open_library_edition_id":"OL24354728M"},"before_row":null},{"key":{"work_id":987111002,"language":"nl"},"seq":10,"relation":"catalog_work_descriptions","after_row":{"text":"Emma Woodhouse is jong, welgesteld en overtuigd van haar inzicht in andere mensen. Ze bemoeit zich graag met hun liefdesleven en verwacht met haar koppelpogingen het beste voor hen te bereiken. Haar voorstellingen blijken echter niet altijd overeen te komen met wat anderen voelen of willen. In de sociale wereld om haar heen krijgen kleine vergissingen grote betekenis. Jane Austen volgt hoe Emma gaandeweg wordt geconfronteerd met de beperkingen van haar oordeel en met haar eigen gevoelens.","work_id":987111002,"evidence":[{"note":"Austen’s complete novel Emma, C.W.Polderman-deVries translation, Spectrum hardcover. No film retelling or new Work. Current1815original year retained;1816on later title-page/bibliographic citations is not automatically a correction. New Dutch full-novel edition does not overwrite the unverified legacy edition.","type":"reviewed_identity_and_bibliography","sources":["http://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p851671039"],"reference":"work:324","checked_at":"2026-11-02T19:50:00.000Z","supplemental":null},{"type":"original_substantive_source_review","review":"content-review-017.json","sources":["https://openlibrary.org/works/OL66513W","https://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p851671039"]},{"type":"cover_front_review","sha256":"8d61ef0c1da111e60cfeaf3a277653551c0a7e237facbf15c2a13d7b59e82b82","cover_id":6579542,"reference":"cover-semantic-review-010.json","limitation":"Actually read cover-large/sheet-002.jpg. Jane Austen; Emma; Kramers Klassieken. Front identity and source-edition attachment are corroboration, not proof of a visible barcode, printing year, language or complete contents. Bibliographic checks remain separate."}],"language":"nl","provenance":"original_source_reviewed_summary","source_url":"https://openlibrary.org/works/OL66513W","reviewed_at":"2026-11-02T19:50:00+00:00","source_name":"Gecontroleerde boek- en catalogusbronnen","source_type":"official_catalog","review_batch":"nl-scale-20261102-012","review_status":"approved","bound_author_id":977300001},"before_row":null},{"key":{"edition_id":987211009},"seq":11,"relation":"catalog_edition_metadata","after_row":{"format":"hardcover","work_id":987111002,"evidence":[{"note":"Austen’s complete novel Emma, C.W.Polderman-deVries translation, Spectrum hardcover. No film retelling or new Work. Current1815original year retained;1816on later title-page/bibliographic citations is not automatically a correction. New Dutch full-novel edition does not overwrite the unverified legacy edition.","type":"reviewed_identity_and_bibliography","sources":["http://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p851671039"],"reference":"work:324","checked_at":"2026-11-02T19:50:00.000Z","supplemental":null},{"type":"original_substantive_source_review","review":"content-review-017.json","sources":["https://openlibrary.org/works/OL66513W","https://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p851671039"]},{"type":"cover_front_review","sha256":"8d61ef0c1da111e60cfeaf3a277653551c0a7e237facbf15c2a13d7b59e82b82","cover_id":6579542,"reference":"cover-semantic-review-010.json","limitation":"Actually read cover-large/sheet-002.jpg. Jane Austen; Emma; Kramers Klassieken. Front identity and source-edition attachment are corroboration, not proof of a visible barcode, printing year, language or complete contents. Bibliographic checks remain separate."}],"cover_url":"https://covers.openlibrary.org/b/id/6579542-L.jpg?default=false","edition_id":987211009,"bound_title":"Emma","reviewed_at":"2026-11-02T19:50:00+00:00","bound_isbn13":"9789027491428","evidence_url":"https://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p851671039","review_batch":"nl-scale-20261102-012","review_status":"approved","bound_language":"dut","card_cover_url":"https://covers.openlibrary.org/b/id/6579542-M.jpg?default=false","bound_author_id":977300001},"before_row":null},{"key":{"open_library_edition_id":"OL24405542M"},"seq":12,"relation":"editions","after_row":{"id":987211010,"title":"De storm","isbn_10":null,"isbn_13":"9789035108363","work_id":987111003,"cover_id":null,"language":"dut","publisher":"Bert Bakker","publish_date":null,"open_library_edition_id":"OL24405542M"},"before_row":null},{"key":{"work_id":987111003,"language":"nl"},"seq":13,"relation":"catalog_work_descriptions","after_row":{"text":"Op een afgelegen eiland leeft Prospero met zijn dochter Miranda, ver van het hertogdom dat hem is afgenomen. Met behulp van zijn kennis en macht roept hij een storm op die vroegere tegenstanders naar het eiland brengt. Hun aankomst geeft hem gelegenheid de verhoudingen te veranderen. Illusie, verlangen en macht bepalen vervolgens de ontmoetingen tussen de eilandbewoners en de schipbreukelingen. Het toneelstuk onderzoekt wat iemand met controle over anderen doet wanneer herstel en vergelding dicht bij elkaar liggen.","work_id":987111003,"evidence":[{"note":"Exact Dutch play TheTempest. GerritKomrij is translator, Shakespeare remains primary author. Full Shakespeare play in Komrij translation, never infer print language or completeness from the legacy educational edition.","type":"reviewed_identity_and_bibliography","sources":["http://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p067411541"],"reference":"work:331","checked_at":"2026-11-02T19:50:00.000Z","supplemental":null},{"type":"original_substantive_source_review","review":"content-review-017.json","sources":["https://openlibrary.org/works/OL362699W","https://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p067411541"]},{"type":"cover_front_review","sha256":"a3b0bfc7d8b56ac429b392194e12db98f593b8595d45c14cd291840de096b389","cover_id":6666745,"reference":"cover-semantic-review-010.json","limitation":"Actually read cover-large/sheet-002.jpg. William Shakespeare; De storm; Gerrit Komrij is translator, not primary author; Bert Bakker. Front identity and source-edition attachment are corroboration, not proof of a visible barcode, printing year, language or complete contents. Bibliographic checks remain separate."}],"language":"nl","provenance":"original_source_reviewed_summary","source_url":"https://openlibrary.org/works/OL362699W","reviewed_at":"2026-11-02T19:50:00+00:00","source_name":"Gecontroleerde boek- en catalogusbronnen","source_type":"official_catalog","review_batch":"nl-scale-20261102-012","review_status":"approved","bound_author_id":987311001},"before_row":null},{"key":{"edition_id":987211010},"seq":14,"relation":"catalog_edition_metadata","after_row":{"format":"hardcover","work_id":987111003,"evidence":[{"note":"Exact Dutch play TheTempest. GerritKomrij is translator, Shakespeare remains primary author. Full Shakespeare play in Komrij translation, never infer print language or completeness from the legacy educational edition.","type":"reviewed_identity_and_bibliography","sources":["http://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p067411541"],"reference":"work:331","checked_at":"2026-11-02T19:50:00.000Z","supplemental":null},{"type":"original_substantive_source_review","review":"content-review-017.json","sources":["https://openlibrary.org/works/OL362699W","https://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p067411541"]},{"type":"cover_front_review","sha256":"a3b0bfc7d8b56ac429b392194e12db98f593b8595d45c14cd291840de096b389","cover_id":6666745,"reference":"cover-semantic-review-010.json","limitation":"Actually read cover-large/sheet-002.jpg. William Shakespeare; De storm; Gerrit Komrij is translator, not primary author; Bert Bakker. Front identity and source-edition attachment are corroboration, not proof of a visible barcode, printing year, language or complete contents. Bibliographic checks remain separate."}],"cover_url":"https://covers.openlibrary.org/b/id/6666745-L.jpg?default=false","edition_id":987211010,"bound_title":"De storm","reviewed_at":"2026-11-02T19:50:00+00:00","bound_isbn13":"9789035108363","evidence_url":"https://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p067411541","review_batch":"nl-scale-20261102-012","review_status":"approved","bound_language":"dut","card_cover_url":"https://covers.openlibrary.org/b/id/6666745-M.jpg?default=false","bound_author_id":987311001},"before_row":null},{"key":{"open_library_edition_id":"OL24405545M"},"seq":15,"relation":"editions","after_row":{"id":987211011,"title":"De koopman van Venetië","isbn_10":null,"isbn_13":"9789035108318","work_id":987111005,"cover_id":null,"language":"dut","publisher":"Bert Bakker","publish_date":null,"open_library_edition_id":"OL24405545M"},"before_row":null},{"key":{"work_id":987111005,"language":"nl"},"seq":16,"relation":"catalog_work_descriptions","after_row":{"text":"Bassanio wil de rijke Portia het hof maken, maar beschikt niet over het geld dat hij daarvoor nodig denkt te hebben. Zijn vriend Antonio helpt hem door een lening aan te gaan bij Shylock. Aan die afspraak is een uitzonderlijke voorwaarde verbonden: als terugbetaling uitblijft, mag de schuldeiser een pond van Antonio''s vlees eisen. Wanneer handelszaken mislopen, krijgt die bepaling een dreigende betekenis. Liefde, vriendschap en geld raken zo verstrengeld in een conflict over de letter en de toepassing van een overeenkomst.","work_id":987111005,"evidence":[{"note":"Exact Dutch play TheMerchantofVenice. GerritKomrij is translator, no contributor-based duplicate Work. Full Shakespeare play, not a Pearson reader adaptation. Retain current Work identity and all existing editions/dependencies.","type":"reviewed_identity_and_bibliography","sources":["http://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p055231942"],"reference":"work:433","checked_at":"2026-11-02T19:50:00.000Z","supplemental":null},{"type":"original_substantive_source_review","review":"content-review-017.json","sources":["https://openlibrary.org/works/OL258758W","https://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p055231942"]},{"type":"cover_front_review","sha256":"3f8261